    <briefdescription>
<para>Extended recovery interface for globally orchestrated 2PC recovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Coordinators implementing this contract can participate in a single recovery pass that reports normalized pre/post in-doubt counts while still using their native WAL or snapshot backend internally.</para>
<para>All three ThemisDB 2PC coordinator types must implement this interface:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>TwoPhaseCommitCoordinator</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_global_transaction_manager" kindref="compound">GlobalTransactionManager</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_distributed_transaction_manager" kindref="compound">DistributedTransactionManager</ref> </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
